####


POST {{baseurl}}/api/uploads
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=MyBoundary

--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="ARAMxLogo.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< C:/Users/Administrator/Downloads/aramxLogo.png
--MyBoundary--
 
