### Example of invalid request (missing email)
POST {{baseurl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "password": "StrongPass123!",
  "phone": "+201234567890",
  "firstName": "Reda",
  "lastName": "Ahmed",
  "merchantName": "MyShop",
  "industry": "Retail"
}



### Login
POST {{baseurl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "email": "owner@myshop.com",
  "password": "StrongPass123!"
}

### user info
GET {{baseurl}}/api/auth/user

### Refresh Token
POST {{baseurl}}/api/auth/refresh-token
###
GET {{baseurl}}/api/merchants/me

### Logout
POST {{baseurl}}/api/auth/logout


